Build against the toolchain the builder image and p4a already provide.

Upstream is on AGP 8.12.3 / gradle 8.14.2, so it fetched a second gradle
distribution and let AGP download its own build-tools from dl.google.com
mid-build, unpinned and unverified.

:app is upstream's sample application; we only ever build the library. It is
dropped from settings.gradle because gradle configures every included project
even when only one is built, and configuring :app fails under AGP 9: it calls
getDefaultProguardFile('proguard-android.txt'), which AGP 9 removed in favour
of the -optimize variant.

Note this does change the resulting aar (10480 bytes, was 10857): the same
sources built by a newer AGP.

The gradle wrapper is pointed at gradle-9.4.1-all, the same distribution p4a's
bootstrap downloads, so the whole build shares one distribution instead of fetching
several, and pinned with distributionSha256Sum so the wrapper verifies it before
executing it. Keep both in sync with p4a's
bootstraps/common/build/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties.

diff --git a/barcodescannerview/build.gradle b/barcodescannerview/build.gradle
index bd26c96..d4759ff 100644
--- a/barcodescannerview/build.gradle
+++ b/barcodescannerview/build.gradle
@@ -17,6 +17,9 @@ plugins {
 android {
 	namespace 'de.markusfisch.android.barcodescannerview'
 	compileSdk sdk_version
+	// electrum: use the build-tools installed in the builder image, instead of
+	// letting AGP download its own default version from Google mid-build
+	buildToolsVersion System.getenv('ANDROID_SDK_BUILD_TOOLS_VERSION')
 
 	defaultConfig {
 		minSdk 9
diff --git a/build.gradle b/build.gradle
index 9be7983..16d84e2 100644
--- a/build.gradle
+++ b/build.gradle
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 buildscript {
 	ext {
-		tools_version = '8.12.3'
+		tools_version = '9.1.0'
 		sdk_version = 36
 	}
 
diff --git a/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties b/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties
index 2bfda95..4e859cd 100644
--- a/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties
+++ b/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 #Wed Jan 26 11:58:22 CET 2022
 distributionBase=GRADLE_USER_HOME
-distributionUrl=https\://services.gradle.org/distributions/gradle-8.14.2-bin.zip
+distributionUrl=https\://services.gradle.org/distributions/gradle-9.4.1-all.zip
+distributionSha256Sum=708d2c6ecc97ca9a11838ef64a6c2301151b8dd10387e22dc1a12c30557cab5b
 distributionPath=wrapper/dists
 zipStorePath=wrapper/dists
 zipStoreBase=GRADLE_USER_HOME
diff --git a/settings.gradle b/settings.gradle
index 0aa4f1f..361c86f 100644
--- a/settings.gradle
+++ b/settings.gradle
@@ -1 +1,3 @@
-include ':app', ':barcodescannerview'
+// electrum: :app is upstream's sample app; we only build the library, and
+// configuring :app fails on AGP 9 (it uses the removed proguard-android.txt)
+include ':barcodescannerview'
